WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.175
A function with a parameter

2
00:00:02.851 --> 00:00:06.826
In the sidebar, under Functions, add a function. Name it Pick.

3
00:00:09.864 --> 00:00:14.514
Plus Parameter. Call it value. It stands for whichever value is picked.

4
00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:21.670
Now the actions the four events shared. Set Chosen, but to value.

5
00:00:28.645 --> 00:00:32.945
Then Go to screen Describe. Each button will call Pick with its own value.
